  "content": "<div>\n<div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div><div>\n<p>在這個模組中探索古董交易船！</p>\n<p>在船上，您還會遇到準備與您交易的村民。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/975/316/front-view.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"390\" height=\"219\"><img style=\"float:right\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/975/317/side-view.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"390\" height=\"220\"></p>\n<p>這艘雄偉的船隻會生成在《Minecraft》的所有海洋中，裝滿了寶藏和神秘戰利品。</p>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">YouTube 模組展示影片：</span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe style=\"width:400px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/W55RbgUpsdI?t=13s\" width=\"309\" height=\"258\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<hr>\n<p>歡迎在您的模組包中使用此模組！</p>\n</div>",
